><00:00:02.138><c>continue </c><00:00:02.144><c>in </c><00:00:02.150><c>the </c><00:00:02.156><c>direction </c><00:00:02.162><c>of  </c><00:00:02.168><c>greater </c><00:00:02.174><c>generality </c><00:00:02.180><c>we </c><00:00:02.186><c>will </c><00:00:02.192><c>see </c><00:00:02.198><c>that </c><00:00:02.204><c>by  </c><00:00:02.210><c>repeated </c><00:00:02.216><c>use </c><00:00:02.222><c>of </c><00:00:02.228><c>various </c><00:00:02.234><c>sample </c><00:00:02.240><c>means  </c><00:00:02.246><c>we </c><00:00:02.252><c>can </c><00:00:02.258><c>also </c><00:00:02.264><c>estimate </c><00:00:02.270><c>more </c><00:00:02.276><c>complicated  </c><00:00:02.282><c>quantities </c><00:00:02.288><c>such </c><00:00:02.294><c>as </c><00:00:02.300><c>for </c><00:00:02.306><c>example </c><00:00:02.312><c>the  </c><00:00:02.318><c>correlation </c><00:00:02.324><c>coefficient </c><00:00:02.330><c>between </c><00:00:02.336><c>two  </c><00:00:02.342><c>random </c><00:00:02.348><c>variables </c><00:00:02.354><c>we </c><00:00:02.360><c>will </c><00:00:02.366><c>conclude </c><00:00:02.372><c>by  </c><00:00:02.378><c>introducing </c><00:00:02.384><c>a </c><00:00:02.390><c>general </c><00:00:02.396><c>estimation  </c><00:00:02.402><c>methodology </c><00:00:02.408><c>the </c><00:00:02.414><c>so </c><00:00:02.420><c>called </c><00:00:02.426><c>maximum  </c><00:00:02.432><c>likelihood </c><00:00:02.438><c>estimation </c><00:00:02.444><c>method </c><00:00:02.450><c>this </c><00:00:02.456><c>is </c><00:00:02.462><c>a  </c><00:00:02.468><c>method </c><00:00:02.474><c>that </c><00:00:02.480><c>applies </c><00:00:02.486><c>always </c><00:00:02.492><c>even </c><00:00:02.498><c>when </c><00:00:02.504><c>the  </c><00:00:02.510><c>unknown </c><00:00:02.516><c>parameter </c><00:00:02.522><c>of </c><00:00:02.528><c>interest </c><00:00:02.534><c>cannot </c><00:00:02.540><c>be  </c><00:00:02.546><c>interpreted </c><00:00:02.552><c>as </c><00:00:02.558><c>an </c><00:00:02.564><c>expectation </c><00:00: